sh every visitor toward buying equipment. Some results will show a long payback or limited runtime. That is still a useful result."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Editorial standard"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Public data does not make an estimate automatically accurate for one home. We state the data year, make defaults editable, identify exclusions and distinguish an educational estimate from professional advice."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Contact"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["For a correction request, include the page, inputs, result and the source or reasoning that suggests a change. Email ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:hello@homeenergycostlab.com","children":"hello@homeenergycostlab.com"}],"."]}]]}]]}],["$","footer",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"brand footer-brand","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"brand-mark","children":["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-zap"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Home Energy ",["$","b",null,{"children":"Cost Lab"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Independent estimates for better home-energy decisions. Not financial, tax or engineering advice."}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"href":"/methodology","children":"Methodology"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"href":"/about","children":"About"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"href":"/privacy","children":"Privacy"}]]}]]}]]}]
